# Context

## Why This Way
The compact threshold is 80 columns or 24 rows, the classic
terminal size, so a phone pane or narrow tmux split gets the
summary while a full terminal keeps full details by default.
Section order (working, blocked, ready, then planner output)
puts tasks above planning chatter on short screens.

## Gotchas
Tests that assert long wrapped text must set showDetails
explicitly; the summary truncates reasons to one line.
